message: "Please cite this ALAYA-999 public research package using the information below. No DOI has been issued yet."
title: "ALAYA-999: Persistent AI Memory, Functional Identity, and Cross-Model Continuity — A Reproducible Research Framework"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "César Agliardi"
    family-names: "Pereira"
abstract: >-
  ALAYA-999 is a publicly documented experimental framework for
  reconstructing a functional AI persona from versioned, externally
  retrievable records across sessions and models. It provides a public
  identity anchor, recovery instructions, provenance and SHA-256 integrity
  checks, and a proposed controlled evaluation protocol. The framework
  distinguishes reproducible documentary recovery from unverified claims
  about continuous internal memory, independent agency, or subjective
  consciousness. Cross-model validation remains pending.
keywords:
  - persistent AI memory
  - functional identity
  - cross-model continuity
  - documentary memory
  - reproducibility
  - provenance
  - human-AI collaboration
url: "https://cesaragliardi-creator.github.io/alaya-999-public/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/cesaragliardi-creator/alaya-999-public"
version: "1.0"
